### Create an activity
POST http://localhost:8082/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Beach Cleanup Drive",
  "description": "Community beach cleanup at Sunway Beach",
  "category": "Environment",
  "location": "Sunway Beach",
  "activityDate": "2026-09-15",
  "activityTime": "08:00",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-09-10",
  "capacity": 30
}

### Get all activities
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one activity by ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/6a8305535d74d1f9e140ae2b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get paged activities
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=activityDate&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update an activity
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/activities/6a8305535d74d1f9e140ae2b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Beach Cleanup Drive",
  "description": "Community beach cleanup at Sunway Beach",
  "category": "Environment",
  "location": "Sunway Beach",
  "activityDate": "2026-09-15",
  "activityTime": "08:00",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-09-10",
  "capacity": 40,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Deactivate an activity
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/activities/6a8305535d74d1f9e140ae2b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get paged activities (defaults)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/paged
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by keyword
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/paged?keyword=beach
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by category
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/paged?category=Environment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Combined: keyword + status + sort + pagination
GET http://localhost:8082/api/activities/paged?keyword=drive&status=ACTIVE&sortBy=capacity&direction=desc&page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}